---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Licensed Games | CCG Eleventy Prototype
description: Browse the source-backed licensed games collection from the existing Cheeky Commodore Gamer archive.
permalink: /games/collections/licensed-games/index.html
---
<section class="hero hero--compact">
  <p class="eyebrow">COLLECTION PROTOTYPE</p>
  <h1>{{ collectionArchive.licensed.name }}</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ collectionArchive.licensed.description }}</p>
</section>

<section class="archive-browser" aria-labelledby="licensed-games-heading">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <h2 id="licensed-games-heading">Games in this collection</h2>
    <p>{{ collectionArchive.licensed.games | length }} entries preserved from the existing collection fallback markup.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="game-grid">
    {% for game in collectionArchive.licensed.games %}
      {% include "components/game-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
